{"about_the_game":"Double is an action-quest game telling about a fight with a mental disorder by immersing in dreams. Choose your way and find out how this mystical story ends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887820/extras/9bcfae3c735bebefd64ba684476f0665.poster.avif?t=1766933660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887820/extras/9bcfae3c735bebefd64ba684476f0665.webm?t=1766933660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887820/extras/9bcfae3c735bebefd64ba684476f0665.mp4?t=1766933660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Carlos stays in a mental asylum and tries to overcome his post-war syndrome. Every day he must make a decision: continue his treatment or surrender to illusions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear story that forces to make decisions in hard and ambiguous situations.<br></li><li>Connection between dreams and reality. As time passes, the invasiveness of dreams into reality keeps growing.<br></li><li>Original soundtrack that will blow you away.</li></ul><br>For Support and Bug reports, email us at <a href=\"mailto:tomatofantasygames@gmail.com\">tomatofantasygames@gmail.com</a>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sniper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/887820/f7fe738023dd981bb4ffeae1571b0cd77b1a95a2.jpg"},{"name":"Don't rush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/887820/911898ce3ab9bc3dcd369713d01684d4e40f5271.jpg"},{"name":"I'll wait","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/887820/3118da176fb30f7b998cf27f0d451f14eedf2726.jpg"},{"name":"Postman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu